# EVEMU 1.3
# A DualShock 3 as the kernel's hid-sony driver shows it (its buttons and sticks; the motion sensors
# are a separate device): written by hand for the smoke recipes' virtual pad (bench/lib/smoke.inc
# smoke_pad), not recorded. Buttons: BTN_SOUTH Cross, BTN_EAST Circle, BTN_NORTH Triangle, BTN_WEST
# Square, BTN_TL/TR L1/R1, BTN_TL2/TR2 L2/R2, BTN_SELECT, BTN_START, BTN_MODE (PS), BTN_THUMBL/R,
# BTN_DPAD_UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT; axes ABS_X/Y left stick, ABS_RX/RY right stick, ABS_Z/RZ L2/R2, 0-255.
N: Sony PLAYSTATION(R)3 Controller
I: 0003 054c 0268 8111
